What is NOT covered
-------------------

No dataset, no recorded session, no trained weight file and no detection dump is
included in this repository (see .gitignore and the "What is deliberately not
included" section of README.md).  Any such artifact obtained elsewhere carries
whatever terms its publisher attached to it.
